B.bcy=s(["D\xfcveler hedef canl\u0131 a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kta tohumlans\u0131n; kolay do\u011fum bo\u011fas\u0131 se\xe7ilsin.","Do\u011fum ekibine m\xfcdahale zamanlamas\u0131 e\u011fitimi."],t.s)
